OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,6,Fand breezy for most of Monday, chance  
OL,7,Fof rain later. Rain likely at times on 
OL,8,FTuesday and Wednesday.                 
